  "description": "EVOPIR crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 2/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C60 H108 Co4 Ho3 N2 O30 1+,C22 H44 Ho1 O10 1-,2(C1 H4 O1),2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Co1 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Co2 (Co) has 6 O neighbors; Ho2A (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Co1A (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Co2A (Co) has 6 O neighbors; Ho3 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.098-3.865 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.39-112.19°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C84H164Co4N2O44Ho4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 4 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)). Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
